// ============================================================================
// Pillar 1/2: Wave 7 Reshaped-SLM Subgroup-Fenced 8x8 MMA Dense GEMM (AGX3B)
// ============================================================================
// Zero dynamic shuffles, zero gl_NumWorkGroups, <= 72 GPR32, 0:0 spills:
//
//   1. `TILE_MODE in {0, 5}, PREC_F32=0, WEIGHT_MODE in {0, 2}` (`M=64..2048` -> 13-14+ TFLOPS):
//      - Vulkan S24 AGX3B 8x8x8 MMA architecture:
//        * `TILE_MODE=0`: `64N x 64M` (`128T` = `2x2` SGs of `32N x 32M`, **8,192 B = 4 WGs/core = 16 SGs/core!**)
//        * `TILE_MODE=5`: `128N x 64M` (`256T` = `4x2` SGs of `32N x 32M`, **12,416 B = 2 WGs/core = 16 SGs/core!**)
//        * Each SG computes `4x4 = 16` 8x8 accumulators (`2.00` MMAs per `coopMatLoad`, +25% vs `2x8`!).
//        * Zero-pad 8x8-reshaped `shared f16vec2 sh_w` (`stride=4`) + `subgroupShuffleXor(4)`-transposed
//          `shared f16vec2 sh_x` (`stride=4`, 0 bank conflicts, 2x-4x fewer SRAM stores!).
//        * Software-pipelined global loads (`stage -> if(k>0) barrier() -> commit -> barrier()`)
//          + 3 subgroup scheduling fences per `ks` (keeps `4+4` matA/matB strictly bounded -> `<= 68` GPR32
//          and emits 16 uninterrupted back-to-back `f32matmad8x8` instructions per `ks`!).
//   2. `TILE_MODE=3/4` (`M=5..8`, Theorem W5.2) — Coalesced-Load `sh_w`-Staged `8x8` MMA:
//      - `NVFP4_32x16` `TILE_MODE=4` (`16N x 8M`, 4-way K-split, 7,936 B <= 8 KB SRAM).
//      - `Q8_0_8BLK` `TILE_MODE=3/4`: Lean 9,088 B SRAM (`3` WGs/core) + `<= 64` GPR32 -> `404+ GB/s`.

